3. Every death costs your team a LIFE. Hit 0 = lose.
4. Scheduled DUELS yank everyone to mid; losers lose 3 lives.
5. Slay the Mid Boss → Secret Shop + God Ascension.

Touch: stick move, ATK / abilities, Shop at stalls.
Desktop: WASD, Space, Q/E/R, F shop."
